# Issue #1156: reports scripts/changed-file-stage-timing.mjs writes on request,
# and the console transcript an operator redirects alongside them. They must stay
# ignored: an untracked report in the worktree would move the working-tree
# identity a stage run attests.
.changed-file-timing*
# Issue #1111: everything the opt-in StrykerJS pilot writes — its sandbox, the
# generated run spec, and the raw HTML/JSON mutation reports. The raw reports
# embed whole source files and absolute sandbox paths, so only the bounded,
# sanitized summary.md is ever quoted in a checked-in report.
.mutation/
